~ start
???: You have reached the top 
???: you being one... gets to decide the flow of life
???: of those beneath you 
???: will you choose to be a benevolent leader
???: or be an Iron hand dectator
???: the choice is yours to make
???: as the one who reached the summit 
???: what fate will thread 
- become a good leader
	if Global.good 
		???: Your wish have come true
		???: the people have admired you 
		???: your country have prospered
		???: you have nothing to worry 
		???: as the corrupt on your side has been cleansed by you
